This licence covers the work added in this repository: the scripts, the
corrections in cns3d_fixed.f, the redrawn figures and their programs, and the
notes. It does not cover the original material:

- report.pdf, code.pdf, and their transcriptions report.md, fig/ and cns3d.f
  reproduce NASA Contractor Report CR-178818, Y. S. Chen, "A Computer Code for
  Three-Dimensional Incompressible Flows Using Nonorthogonal Body-Fitted
  Coordinate Systems", Universities Space Research Association, prepared for
  NASA Marshall Space Flight Center, March 1986 (contract NAS8-35918). The
  report's distribution statement is "Unclassified-Unlimited"; it is
  available from the NASA Technical Reports Server,
  https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/19860017072
